            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.LakeHouseLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.OracleCloudStorageLocation
            and Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.SftpLocation.
            </summary>
